1
00:00:00,377 --> 00:00:05,047
(Sheldon:)But I'm going to take a stab here.
You're either sad or nauseated.

2
00:00:05,841 --> 00:00:07,551
(Raj:)-I'm sad.
-I was going to say sad.

3
00:00:07,718 --> 00:00:09,218
(Sheldon:)I don't know why I hedged.

4
00:00:11,055 --> 00:00:12,095
(Raj:)What are you eating?

5
00:00:12,306 --> 00:00:15,556
(Sheldon:)Elbow macaroni with ground hamburger
and tomato sauce.

6
00:00:15,726 --> 00:00:17,516
(Raj:)Oh, beefaroni.

7
00:00:17,686 --> 00:00:19,356
(Raj:)I think I'll miss you most of all.

8
00:00:20,647 --> 00:00:24,027
(Leonard:)I've always been a little confused
about this. Why don't Hindus eat beef?

9
00:00:24,193 --> 00:00:26,733
(Raj:)-We believe cows are gods.
-Not technically.

10
00:00:26,904 --> 00:00:29,744
(Sheldon:)In Hinduism,
cattle are thought to be like God.

11
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:34,407
Do not tell me about my culture.
I'll take you out, I swear to cow.

12
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:37,910
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

13
00:00:38,457 --> 00:00:40,537
(Raj:)Me too. I'm just-- I'm a little on edge.

14
00:00:40,709 --> 00:00:43,589
Mm, understandable. Your life seems
to be crumbling around you...

15
00:00:43,754 --> 00:00:46,754
(Sheldon:)...and your future appears bleak at best.

16
00:00:47,091 --> 00:00:48,261
(Raj:)Thank you.

17
00:00:48,425 --> 00:00:50,965
(Sheldon:)And you're wrong
about Hinduism and cows.

18
00:00:51,428 --> 00:00:54,808
Hey, Raj, Professor Laughlin
is looking for someone to join...

19
00:00:54,973 --> 00:00:58,773
(Howard(arriving):)-...the stellar evolution research team.
-You're kidding. That's fantastic.

